// Test: Nullable/null value checking
// Spec: 08-FFI.md § 3.2 Pointers
// Priority: P2 - Enhancement
//
// Tests null value checking with is_null() function
// Note: Full pointer type support (*◆ T) is a future enhancement

rite main() {
    // Test is_null() function on null value
    ≔ val = null;
    ⎇ is_null(val) {
        println(1);
    } ⎉ {
        println(0);
    }
}
